classify.user:
Classify this email into one of: inquiry (询问产品/价格), quote (报价相关), complaint (质量/投诉), logistics (物流/交期/单据), other.
Return JSON only: {"intent": "...", "language": "zh|en|mixed", "urgency": "low|normal|high"}

EMAIL:
{email}

extract.user:
Extract from the email into this JSON shape:
{{"buyer": string-or-null, "products": [{{"sku": string, "qty": string, "desc": string-or-null}}], "incoterm": string-or-null, "payment_terms": string-or-null, "deadline": string-or-null, "amounts": [string], "not_stated": [string]}}
Rules: qty as written (e.g. "5,000"), amounts as written. Every field not present goes into not_stated.

EMAIL:
{email}

draft.user:
Email from customer:
{email}

Extraction:
{extraction}

Write a concise professional reply (<=150 chars) that: 1) acknowledges the customer, 2) answers only what we know, 3) for each not_stated item says we will confirm shortly. Output only the reply text.
